kind check-if
title Check if a terminal shows an effect, and which one.
intro A terminal's card in the Flow tab shows what the terminal draws: its font set, its look and the look's vtlook, the effect.
see effects/give-a-look-a-vtlook
waits-for audit 9: "vtium-config does not read a look's vtlook file yet"

file etc/vtium.conf
    version = 1
    font-name = unifont
    [look warm]
    vtlook = amber
    [head console]
    vt = 5
    look = warm
file etc/batch.conf
    ROOT/fonts/mono.bdf
font fonts/mono.bdf 8x16
file etc/looks/amber.vtlook
    version = 1
    [color tint]
    color = 255,176,0
    amount = 1.0
    floor = 0.0

1. Go to the Flow tab.
2. Choose console.
at the terminal's card
check screen lacks "does not read a look's vtlook file yet"
check screen shows "amber"
